#. i18n: tag label
#. i18n: file taskbar.kcfg line 11
#: rc.cpp:4
#, no-c-format
msgid "Show windows from all desktops"
msgstr "Finstern vun all Schriefdischen wiesen"

#. i18n: tag whatsthis
#. i18n: file taskbar.kcfg line 12
#: rc.cpp:8
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Turning this option off will cause the taskbar to display <b>only</b> the "
"windows on the current desktop. \\n\\nBy default, this option is selected "
"and all windows are shown."
msgstr ""
"Wenn nich aktiveert, warrt de Programmbalken <b>bloots</b> de Finstern vun "
"den aktuellen Schriefdisch wiesen.\\n\\nStandardwies is dat aktiveert, all "
"Finstern warrt wiest."

#. i18n: tag label
#. i18n: file taskbar.kcfg line 16
#: rc.cpp:12
#, no-c-format
msgid "Show only minimized windows"
msgstr "Bloots minimeert Finstern wiesen"

#. i18n: tag whatsthis
#. i18n: file taskbar.kcfg line 17
#: rc.cpp:16
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Select this option if you want the taskbar to display <b>only</b> minimized "
"windows. \\n\\nBy default, this option is not selected and the taskbar will "
"show all windows."
msgstr ""
"Aktiveer dit, wenn de Programmbalken <b>bloots</b>minimeert Finstern wiesen "
"schall. \\n\\nDisse Optschoon is standardwies nich aktiveert, all Finstern "
"warrt wiest."

#. i18n: tag label
#. i18n: file taskbar.kcfg line 22
#: rc.cpp:20
#, no-c-format
msgid "Never"
msgstr "Nienich"

#. i18n: tag label
#. i18n: file taskbar.kcfg line 25
#: rc.cpp:24
#, no-c-format
msgid "When Taskbar Full"
msgstr "Bi vull Programmbalken"

#. i18n: tag label
#. i18n: file taskbar.kcfg line 28
#: rc.cpp:28
#, no-c-format
msgid "Always"
msgstr "Jümmers"

#. i18n: tag label
#. i18n: file taskbar.kcfg line 32
#: rc.cpp:32
#, no-c-format
msgid "Group similar tasks:"
msgstr "Lieke Finstern tosamenkoppeln:"

#. i18n: tag whatsthis
#. i18n: file taskbar.kcfg line 33
#: rc.cpp:36
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The taskbar can group similar windows into single buttons. When one of these "
"window group buttons are clicked on a menu appears showing all the windows "
"in that group. This can be especially useful with the <em>Show all windows</"
"em> option.\\n\\nYou can set the taskbar to <strong>Never</strong> group "
"windows, to <strong>Always</strong> group windows or to group windows only "
"<strong>When the Taskbar is Full</strong>.\\n\\nBy default the taskbar "
"groups windows when it is full."
msgstr ""
"De Programmbalken kann lieke Finstern in een Knoop tosamenfaten. Wenn Du op "
"so en Koppelknoop klickst, warrt en Menü mit all Finstern binnen dat Koppel "
"wiest. Tosamen mit de <em>All Finstern wiesen</em>-Optschoon kann dat bannig "
"goot wesen.\\n\\nDu kannst fastleggen, dat de Programmbalken Finstern "
"<strong>Nienich</strong>, <strong>Jümmers</strong>, oder bloots <strong>Bi "
"vullen Programmbalken</strong> tosamenkoppeln schall.\\n\\nStandardwies "
"koppelt de Programmbalken Finstern tosamen, wenn he vull is."

#. i18n: tag label
#. i18n: file taskbar.kcfg line 37
#: rc.cpp:40
#, no-c-format
msgid "Sort windows by desktop"
msgstr "Finstern na Schriefdisch anornen"

#. i18n: tag whatsthis
#. i18n: file taskbar.kcfg line 38
#: rc.cpp:44
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Selecting this option causes the taskbar to show windows in order of the "
"desktop they appear on.\\n\\nBy default this option is selected."
msgstr ""
"Wenn aktiveert, warrt Finstern in de Reeg vun ehr Schriefdischen wiest.\\n"
"\\nStandardwies is dat aktiveert."

#. i18n: tag label
#. i18n: file taskbar.kcfg line 42
#: rc.cpp:48
#, no-c-format
msgid "Sort windows by application"
msgstr "Finstern na Programm anornen"

#. i18n: tag whatsthis
#. i18n: file taskbar.kcfg line 43
#: rc.cpp:52
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Selecting this option causes the taskbar to show windows ordered by "
"application.\\n\\nBy default this option is selected."
msgstr ""
"Wenn aktiveert, warrt Finstern in de Reeg vun ehr Programmen wiest.\\n"
"\\nStandardwies is dat aktiveert."

#. i18n: tag label
#. i18n: file taskbar.kcfg line 47
#: rc.cpp:56
#, no-c-format
msgid "Show application icons"
msgstr "Programm-Lüttbiller wiesen"

#. i18n: tag whatsthis
#. i18n: file taskbar.kcfg line 48
#: rc.cpp:60
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Select this option if you want window icons to appear along with their "
"titles in the taskbar.\\n\\nBy default this option is selected."
msgstr ""
"Aktiveer dit, wenn de Finster-Lüttbiller blang ehr Titeln op den "
"Programmbalken wiest warrn schöölt.\\n\\nStandardwies is dat aktiveert."

#. i18n: tag label
#. i18n: file taskbar.kcfg line 53
#: rc.cpp:64
#, no-c-format
msgid "The maximum width of a task button"
msgstr "De gröttste Breed vun en Programmknoop"

#. i18n: tag whatsthis
#. i18n: file taskbar.kcfg line 54
#: rc.cpp:68
#, no-c-format
msgid "If set to 0 then the hardcoded default is used."
msgstr "Wenn op 0 sett, warrt de Standardweert bruukt"

#. i18n: tag label
#. i18n: file taskbar.kcfg line 58
#: rc.cpp:72
#, no-c-format
msgid "The minimum height of a task buttons in pixels"
msgstr "De lüttste Hööchde vun en Programmknoop in Pixels"

#. i18n: tag whatsthis
#. i18n: file taskbar.kcfg line 60
#: rc.cpp:76
#, no-c-format
msgid "This value must be at least 18 due to icons being 16 pixels high."
msgstr "De Weert mutt tominnst 18 wesen, Lüttbiller sünd 16 Pixels hooch."

#. i18n: tag label
#. i18n: file taskbar.kcfg line 64
#: rc.cpp:80
#, no-c-format
msgid "Show windows from all screens"
msgstr "Finstern vun all Schirmen wiesen"

#. i18n: tag whatsthis
#. i18n: file taskbar.kcfg line 65
#: rc.cpp:84
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Turning this option off will cause the taskbar to display <b>only</b> "
"windows which are on the same Xinerama screen as the taskbar.\\n\\nBy "
"default, this option is selected and all windows are shown."
msgstr ""
"Wenn nich aktiveert, warrt de Programmbalken <b>bloots</b> Finstern wiesen, "
"de op den sülven Xinerama-Schirm liggt as de Programmbalken.\\n"
"\\nStandardwies is dat aktiveert, de Balken wiest all Finstern."

#. i18n: tag label
#. i18n: file taskbar.kcfg line 69
#: rc.cpp:88
#, no-c-format
msgid "The font used in task buttons"
msgstr "De Schriftoort för de Programmknööp"

#. i18n: tag label
#. i18n: file taskbar.kcfg line 74
#: rc.cpp:93
#, no-c-format
msgid "Show window list button"
msgstr "Knoop för Finsterlist wiesen"

#. i18n: tag whatsthis
#. i18n: file taskbar.kcfg line 75
#: rc.cpp:97
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Selecting this option causes the taskbar to display a button that, when "
"clicked, shows a list of all windows in a popup menu."
msgstr ""
"Wenn aktiveert, wiest de Programmbalken en Knoop, mit den Du en Menü för all "
"Finstern opropen kannst."

#. i18n: tag label
#. i18n: file taskbar.kcfg line 87
#: rc.cpp:101
#, no-c-format
msgid "Show Task List"
msgstr "Programmlist wiesen"

#. i18n: tag label
#. i18n: file taskbar.kcfg line 90
#: rc.cpp:105
#, no-c-format
msgid "Show Operations Menu"
msgstr "Akschonenmenü wiesen"

#. i18n: tag label
#. i18n: file taskbar.kcfg line 93
#: rc.cpp:109
#, no-c-format
msgid "Activate, Raise or Minimize Task"
msgstr "Programm aktiveren, na vörn halen oder minimeren"

#. i18n: tag label
#. i18n: file taskbar.kcfg line 96
#: rc.cpp:113
#, no-c-format
msgid "Activate Task"
msgstr "Programm aktiveren"

#. i18n: tag label
#. i18n: file taskbar.kcfg line 99
#: rc.cpp:117
#, no-c-format
msgid "Raise Task"
msgstr "Programm na vörn halen"

#. i18n: tag label
#. i18n: file taskbar.kcfg line 102
#: rc.cpp:121
#, no-c-format
msgid "Lower Task"
msgstr "Programm na achtern stellen"

#. i18n: tag label
#. i18n: file taskbar.kcfg line 105
#: rc.cpp:125
#, no-c-format
msgid "Minimize Task"
msgstr "Programm minimeren"

#. i18n: tag label
#. i18n: file taskbar.kcfg line 108
#: rc.cpp:129
#, no-c-format
msgid "Move To Current Desktop"
msgstr "Na dissen Schriefdisch verschuven"

#. i18n: tag label
#. i18n: file taskbar.kcfg line 114
#: rc.cpp:133
#, no-c-format
msgid "Mouse button actions"
msgstr "Muusknoop-Akschonen"

#. i18n: tag whatsthis
#. i18n: file taskbar.kcfg line 115
#: rc.cpp:137
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can set the actions that occur when using the left, right and middle "
"mouse buttons on task buttons. These include bringing the associated window "
"to the front, minimizing it, showing the context (or operations) menu, etc."
msgstr ""
"Du kannst de Akschonen fastleggen, de Du mit de Muusknööp över de "
"Programmknööp opropen kannst. As Bispeel kannst Du dat tohören Finster na "
"vörn halen, minimeren, sien Rechtsklickmenü wiesen, usw."

#. i18n: tag label
#. i18n: file taskbar.kcfg line 122
#: rc.cpp:141
#, no-c-format
msgid "Draw taskbar entries \"flat\" and not as a button"
msgstr "Programmbalken-Indrääg even wiesen, nich as Knoop"

#. i18n: tag whatsthis
#. i18n: file taskbar.kcfg line 123
#: rc.cpp:145
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Turning this option on will cause the taskbar to draw visible button frames "
"for each entry in the taskbar. \\n\\nBy default, this option is off."
msgstr ""
"Wenn aktiveert, warrt Knööp op den Programmbalken en sichtbor Rahmen hebben."
"\\n\\nStandardwies is dat nich aktiveert."

#. i18n: tag label
#. i18n: file taskbar.kcfg line 127
#: rc.cpp:149
#, no-c-format
msgid "Draw taskbar text with a halo around it"
msgstr "Ümreet för Programmbalken-Text bruken"

#. i18n: tag whatsthis
#. i18n: file taskbar.kcfg line 128
#: rc.cpp:153
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Turning this option on will cause the taskbar to draw fancier text that has "
"an outline around it. While this is useful for transparent panels or "
"particularly dark panel backgrounds, it is slower."
msgstr ""
"Wenn aktiveert, warrt Text op den Programmbalken mit en Ümreet dorstellt, he "
"warrt denn op dörsichtige Paneels oder vör en düüsteren Achtergrund beter "
"leesbor; man dat is ok langsamer."

#. i18n: tag label
#. i18n: file taskbar.kcfg line 132
#: rc.cpp:157
#, no-c-format
msgid "Show a visible button frame on the task the cursor is positioned over"
msgstr "Knooprahmen för Programm ünner de Muus wiesen"

#. i18n: tag label
#. i18n: file taskbar.kcfg line 136
#: rc.cpp:161
#, no-c-format
msgid "Show thumbnails instead of icons in the mouse-over effects"
msgstr "Vöransichten ansteed vun Lüttbiller för Ünner-Muus-Effekten bruken"

#. i18n: tag whatsthis
#. i18n: file taskbar.kcfg line 137
#: rc.cpp:165
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Enabling this option will draw a thumbnail of the window in its mouse-over "
"effect.<p>If a window is minimized or resides on a different desktop while "
"the taskbar is starting, an icon is shown until the window is restored or "
"the appropriate desktop is activated, respectively.</p>"
msgstr ""
"Wenn aktiveert, warrt en Vöransicht vun dat Finster för den Ünner-Muus-"
"Effekt bruukt.<p>Wenn bi den Start vun den Programmbalken en Finster "
"minimeert is oder op en anner Schriefdisch liggt, warrt en Lüttbild wiest, "
"bet dat Finster wedderherstellt oder de annere Schriefdisch aktiveert warrt."
"</p>"

#. i18n: tag label
#. i18n: file taskbar.kcfg line 141
#: rc.cpp:169
#, no-c-format
msgid "Maximum width/height of the thumbnail in pixels"
msgstr "Maximaal Breed/Hööchde vun de Vöransicht in Pixels"

#. i18n: tag whatsthis
#. i18n: file taskbar.kcfg line 142
#: rc.cpp:173
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A thumbnail is created by resizing the window. The scaling factor is "
"determined by its largest dimension and this value. In doing so, the "
"thumbnail's size will not exceed this value in any dimension."
msgstr ""
"En Vöransicht warrt dör dat Ännern vun de Finstergrött opstellt. De "
"Proportschoon warrt dör de gröttste Utdehnen un dissen Weert fastleggt. Dör "
"disse Metood warrt de Vöransicht in keen Richt grötter as disse Weert."

#: taskbarbindings.cpp:36
msgid "Next Taskbar Entry"
msgstr "Nakamen Programmbalken-Indrag"

#: taskbarbindings.cpp:37
msgid "Previous Taskbar Entry"
msgstr "Verleden Programmbalken-Indrag"

#: taskcontainer.cpp:579 taskcontainer.cpp:1578
msgid "modified"
msgstr "ännert"

#: taskcontainer.cpp:1495
msgid "Loading application ..."
msgstr "Programm warrt laadt ..."

#: taskcontainer.cpp:1559
msgid "On all desktops"
msgstr "Op all Schriefdischen"

#: taskcontainer.cpp:1564
#, qt-format
msgctxt "On <virtual desktop name>"
msgid "On %1"
msgstr "Op %1"

#: taskcontainer.cpp:1570
msgid "Requesting attention"
msgstr "Bruukt Acht"

#: taskcontainer.cpp:1576
msgid "Has unsaved changes"
msgstr "Hett nich sekerte Ännern"
